Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.02,0:01:26.27,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}超越昨天仰望過的天際
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.52,0:01:37.41,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}手掌裡攥緊的就是希望
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.66,0:01:46.75,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}已然發現眼前的風景
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.08,0:01:51.80,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}其實全都不值一提
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.34,0:01:57.01,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}只要能遇見你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.26,0:02:01.64,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}世界也可以輕易顛覆
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.64,0:02:08.56,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}前路充滿未知  只需要笑臉相迎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.81,0:02:14.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}就還能走得很長很長
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.24,0:02:20.37,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在遙遠的地方  已然追上你的腳步
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.70,0:02:25.91,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}心中的思緒不可撼動
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.12,0:02:37.01,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}追求無人知曉的頂點  竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:20.81,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}就在這裡  脫胎換骨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:26.27,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}超越昨天仰望過的天際
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:37.41,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}手掌裡攥緊的就是希望
