Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:08.56,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}前路充滿未知  只需要笑臉相迎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:14.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}就還能走得很長很長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:20.37,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}在遙遠的地方  已然追上你的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:25.91,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}心中的思緒不可撼動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:37.01,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}追求無人知曉的頂點  竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:15.75,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}あきらめちゃっていいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:19.71,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}やめちゃえって思うのに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.05,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}逃げ出すことさえできなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:26.72,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}フラフラ、フラフラ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:30.51,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信が無くてそのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:34.47,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自分自身も出せなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.94,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信無くしてスパイラル
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.65,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}グルグル、グルグル
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:47.99,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}でも出逢えたから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:54.83,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}もう見失わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.58,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑顔があれば、
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.25,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:01.08,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}豪華な品も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.88,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}派手な飾りも、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.59,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.63,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}食卓囲もう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.43,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}昨日のミスも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:10.26,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}不安な明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:11.43,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:13.93,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}ねぇ、いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.81,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}凝った味付けも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:17.68,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}シャレた盛り付けも、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:19.39,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:21.40,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}涙の味はも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:23.19,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}しょっぱいとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.19,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}最後にいつも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:28.57,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.87,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}それがスパイス
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:15.75,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明放棄比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:19.71,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明想著不要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.05,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是卻連逃開也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:26.72,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}搖搖晃晃  搖搖晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:30.51,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:34.47,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不會好好表達自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.94,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在丟失了自信的螺旋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.65,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一圈一圈  一圈一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:47.99,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是已經相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:54.83,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不會再弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.58,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要有了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.25,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:01.08,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華的餐品也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.88,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}華麗的裝飾也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.59,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.63,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}餐桌上已經
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.43,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}昨天的錯誤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:10.26,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不安的明天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:11.43,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}全部擺上了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:13.93,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}呐  多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.81,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}凝固的調料也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:17.68,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}精美的裝盤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:19.39,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:21.40,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}眼淚的味道已經
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:23.19,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算變得鹹鹹的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.19,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最後也會一直
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:28.57,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.87,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這就是調味品
